{
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "description": "Prometheus datasource (Grafana Cloud) scraping the DGX exporters via Grafana Agent.",
      "label": "Prometheus",
      "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
      "pluginId": "prometheus",
      "pluginName": "Prometheus",
      "type": "datasource"
    }
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "description": "DGX (spark-2c14 / dgx-llm-1) observability. VERSIONED 2026-08-30 \u2014 was UI-only and almost entirely dead: every panel filtered on host=\"dgx\", a label these metrics do not carry (they use instance=\"dgx-llm-1\", cluster=\"dgx\"). Fixed here, along with the unavailable FB_*/PROF_* fields and a wrong pyannote service label. Source of truth is now this file in git; edit here, not in the UI.",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 100,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "GPU (DCGM)",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Per-GPU utilization percentage. GB10 has 1 GPU; series count = 1.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "max": 100,
          "min": 0,
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 1,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "DCGM_FI_DEV_GPU_UTIL{instance=\"dgx-llm-1\"}",
          "legendFormat": "GPU {{gpu}} ({{modelName}})",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "GPU utilization",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "REPLACED 2026-08-30. The original DCGM_FI_DEV_FB_USED/FB_FREE queries returned 0 series: GB10 is UNIFIED memory, there is no framebuffer (nvidia-smi -q -d MEMORY reports N/A). For GPU memory use the 'Host memory' panel below (host RAM IS GPU RAM here) or, per-process, `nvidia-smi --query-compute-apps=pid,process_name,used_memory`. This slot now carries the throttle bitmask, which IS supported and is what separates 'hot but fine' from 'silently clock-limited'.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 2,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "DCGM_FI_DEV_CLOCK_THROTTLE_REASONS",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "throttle bitmask"
        }
      ],
      "title": "GPU clock throttle reasons (0 = none)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "GPU temperature in \u00b0C. Alert candidate: sustained > 80\u00b0C indicates fan/airflow problem.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 75
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 85
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "celsius"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "id": 3,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "DCGM_FI_DEV_GPU_TEMP{instance=\"dgx-llm-1\"}",
          "legendFormat": "GPU {{gpu}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "GPU temperature",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "GPU power draw (Watts). GB10 nominal envelope is well below 450W; helps detect runaway workloads.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "watt"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 9
      },
      "id": 4,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "DCGM_FI_DEV_POWER_USAGE{instance=\"dgx-llm-1\"}",
          "legendFormat": "GPU {{gpu}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "GPU power",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "REPLACED 2026-08-30. DCGM_FI_PROF_SM_ACTIVE returned 0 series \u2014 every DCGM_FI_PROF_* profiling field is silently unavailable on this GB10 (12 of the 25 default fields are). SM clock is the supported substitute: a sustained drop at stable load is the observable proxy for throttling, corroborating the panel above.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "max": 100,
          "min": 0,
          "unit": "rothz"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 9
      },
      "id": 5,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "DCGM_FI_DEV_SM_CLOCK",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "SM clock MHz"
        }
      ],
      "title": "GPU SM clock (MHz)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17
      },
      "id": 101,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "System (node-exporter)",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Host RAM used vs available. **GB10 has 121 GiB unified CPU+GPU memory** \u2014 cap was the load-bearing finding behind #963 (vLLM 0.92 OOM'd the host).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "decbytes"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "id": 6,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "node_memory_MemTotal_bytes{instance=\"dgx-llm-1\"} - node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes{instance=\"dgx-llm-1\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Used (host)",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes{instance=\"dgx-llm-1\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Available (host)",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Host memory",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Per-mode CPU usage on the host. Pyannote and Whisper drive `system` + `iowait`; vLLM drives `user`.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "max": 1.0,
          "min": 0,
          "unit": "percentunit"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 18
      },
      "id": 7,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "avg by (mode) (rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{instance=\"dgx-llm-1\",mode!=\"idle\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{mode}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Host CPU by mode",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26
      },
      "id": 102,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Containers (cAdvisor)",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Requires cadvisor >= v0.52.1: v0.49.1's Docker API client (1.41) is below the daemon minimum (1.44), its docker factory fails to register, and every series loses the `name` label \u2014 emptying this panel. Bumped 2026-08-30.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "decbytes"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27
      },
      "id": 8,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "container_memory_working_set_bytes{instance=\"dgx-llm-1\",name!=\"\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Container memory",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Requires cadvisor >= v0.52.1: v0.49.1's Docker API client (1.41) is below the daemon minimum (1.44), its docker factory fails to register, and every series loses the `name` label \u2014 emptying this panel. Bumped 2026-08-30.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 27
      },
      "id": 9,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{instance=\"dgx-llm-1\",name!=\"\"}[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "{{name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Container CPU rate",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 35
      },
      "id": 103,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "App: pyannote-server (#942/#943)",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Request rate per handler. /v1/diarize is the only meaningful one; health-check rate confirms scrape reachability.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 36
      },
      "id": 10,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (handler) (rate(http_requests_total{service=\"pyannote\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{handler}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Pyannote request rate",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Pyannote /v1/diarize p50 + p95 + p99 latency. Pair with #954 client-side timeout (180s default).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 36
      },
      "id": 11,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service=\"pyannote\",handler=\"/v1/diarize\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service=\"pyannote\",handler=\"/v1/diarize\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service=\"pyannote\",handler=\"/v1/diarize\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Pyannote diarize latency",
      "type": "timeseries"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "style": "dark",
  "tags": [
    "dgx",
    "gpu",
    "observability"
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "DGX observability (#943)",
  "uid": "dgx-observability-943",
  "weekStart": ""
}